- warnings that can be raised by this map

Intended use
------------
This map is intended to use for the S1 tyrosine transition in proteins. This is especially useful for examining the dynamics of the protein using fluorescence spectroscopy. 

How to use
----------
This map is intended to be used with the dipole-dipole coupling should the protein have multiple tyrosines. More advanced coupling maps are not implemented.
The map currently only provide the transtion dipole for the examination of anisotropy.

Available parameters
--------------------
At this point the frequency map has no options or parameters.
The current map assume a united atom description of tyrosine.
Difference charges for an all-atom map are available in the difference_charges_aa.txt file, but not currently active.

Warnings that can be raised by this map
---------------------------------------
At this point none
